#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Léarscáileanna"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Taispeáin áit a bhfuil na cuideachtaí ar léarscáil, a chur ar gach seoladh poist as líne ag a postcode nó a bhaile ó táblaí a choimeádtar ar an bhfreastalaí, nó nuair a chuir tú é de láimh; seoladh teagmhála agus do chuid féin a tharraingt ach amháin nuair a iarrann tú, agus a gcuid pointí a choinneáil leo agus a scriosadh leo. Tá an léarscáil tharraingt ag Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) thar tíleanna OpenStreetMap ar (© ranníocóirí OpenStreetMap, ODbL) ach amháin má roghnaíonn Socruithe tíleanna eile nó aon cheann; OpenStreetMap fhoghlaim ansin seoladh gach lucht féachana agus an limistéar a fhéachann siad ar. Tagann áiteanna ó GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; a chód poist CC BY 4.0), ainmneacha na tíre ón CLDR Unicode trí Babel, agus an imlíne domhain ón Domhan Nádúrtha (fearainn phoiblí). Athraigh amach, níl aon leathanach léarscáil agus níl aon seoladh a chur; na comhordanáidí atá stóráilte cheana féin fanacht taifeadta agus teacht ar ais untouched nuair a bhíonn sé a athrú arís."
